8495,8496,8497,8498,8499,8500,8501,8502,8503,8504,8505,8506,8507],"projection_sha256":"421ec8c52f508137825339cb6eed890f9ab24c8cd6909dd05069024fcc609f0e","editorial_excerpt_boundary":true},"chapter_id":"c-nanshi-024-wangmeng","book_id":"b-nanshi-024","work_id":"w-nanshi","source_id":"s-nanshi-024-wangmeng-ws1765279"},{"id":"c-nanshi-024-wangmeng:p004","text":"禎明二年，詔授鎭南大將軍、都督二十四州諸軍事，尋命徙鎭廣州。未之鎭，而隋師濟江，猛總督所部赴援。時廣州刺史臨汝侯方慶、西衡州刺史衡陽王伯信並隸猛督府，各觀望不至。猛使高州刺史戴智烈、清遠太守曾孝遠各以輕兵就斬之而發其兵。及聞台城不守，乃舉哀素服，藉稿不食，歎曰：「申包胥獨何人哉。」因勒兵緣江拒守，以固誠節。及審後主不死，乃遣其部將辛昉馳驛赴京師歸款。隋文帝大悅，謂昉曰：「猛懷其舊主，送故情深，即是我之誠臣。保守一方，不勞兵甲，又是我之功臣。」即日拜昉開府儀同三司，仍詔猛與行軍總管韋洸便留嶺表經略。","mentions":[{"id":"c-nanshi-024-wangmeng:p004:m0040","surface":"猛","start":40,"end":41,"person_id":"72e_1a7_3ac_AAAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-024-wangmeng:p004:m0056","surface":"方慶","start":56,"end":58,"person_id":"eaj_zin_zxy_AB","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-024-wangmeng:p004:m0067","surface":"伯信","start":67,"end":69,"person_id":"5ye_fwj_neh_B","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-024-wangmeng:p004:m0071","surface":"猛","start":71,"end":72,"person_id":"72e_1a7_3ac_AAAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-024-wangmeng:p004:m0081","surface":"猛","start":81,"end":82,"person_id":"72e_1a7_3ac_AAAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-024-wangmeng:p004:m0087","surface":"戴智烈","start":87,"end":90,"person_id":"094_ia6_xvv","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-024-wangmeng:p004:m0095","surface":"曾孝遠","start":95,"end":98,"person_id":"px5_c29_v6z","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-024-wangmeng:p004:m0132","surf